# 6. AI Decision Pipeline

## Overview

The AI Decision Pipeline transforms raw dispute evidence into a transparent, explainable, and policy-compliant decision.

Unlike traditional ML systems that rely on a single prediction model, Aegis Resolve AI orchestrates multiple specialized AI agents that collaboratively investigate the dispute before producing a verdict.

---

## AI Decision Pipeline

