# 8. Request Lifecycle

## End-to-End Request Processing

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram

participant Customer

participant Frontend

participant API

participant CaseService

participant ArbitrationCourt

participant Database

participant Analyst

Customer->>Frontend: Submit Dispute

Frontend->>API: POST /v1/disputes

API->>CaseService: Create Case

CaseService->>Database: Store Case

CaseService->>ArbitrationCourt: Start Investigation

ArbitrationCourt->>Database: Retrieve Evidence

Database-->>ArbitrationCourt: Evidence

ArbitrationCourt-->>CaseService: AI Recommendation

CaseService->>Analyst: Human Review (if required)

Analyst-->>CaseService: Override / Approve

CaseService-->>Frontend: Explainable Verdict

Frontend-->>Customer: Display Decision
```

---

# Request Lifecycle

1. Customer submits dispute.
2. Case is created.
3. Evidence is collected.
4. AI agents investigate.
5. Judge Agent recommends verdict.
6. Confidence & Fairness validation.
7. Human review when necessary.
8. Explainable verdict returned.

